      "id": "claim_2e0ec4a845e646349e404160bab0765b",
      "statement": "The fifth read tool get_skill_archive (decided 2026-10-11, service D17) returns a download descriptor instead of bytes; the route GET /mcp/archive/<id>/<tree>.tar verifies only the X-Harness-Archive-Token header (HMAC-SHA256 over name, tree and expiry, five-minute TTL with sixty seconds leeway, empty 403 on failure), the credential is never placed in the URL per RFC 9110 §17.9, the tar is byte-deterministic via git archive --mtime pinned to the commit time, the signing key is random per process so a restart is a rotation, and no setting was added.",
